    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68781" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόρρια</span></b> , τά, <i><span class="en">
			Paus.
			8.18.5
		</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μούρρινα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Arr.
			<u>Epict.</u>
			3.9.21
		</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορρίνη</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μουρρίνη</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			<u>Peripl.M.Rubr.</u>
			6
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			48
		</span></i>:—name of an Oriental material used for cups and vases,
			perh.<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>agate</i>; also a
			glass imitation, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				36.198
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				37.18
			</span></i>.</div>
